png-rs
Copyright 2026 Chris Dobbyn

The decode flow of this crate derives from src/image/png_read.rs of
github.com/dobbo-ca/byblos-rs at 7131963 (Apache-2.0, same owner), which is itself a port of
the Go 1.27 standard library package image/png. png-rs is a new crate, not a port of one Go
repository; docs/design.md describes what it keeps from that file.

